---
manual: art.rect.styles
lines: [1781, 1781]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  @box = rect left: 10, top: 10, width: 30, height: 30
end
----------- test code
box = rect("@box")
assert_equal 30, box.width

box.style(width: 60, curve: 8)

assert_equal 60, box.width, "style changes the width"
assert_equal 8, box.curve, "and the corner radius"
